{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/Library_Header_2.png?t=1742371748\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>How do you revive an angel?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Reviving An Angel promises to offer a different experience derived from the older classics with a unique turn-based system, interesting storylines and engaging characters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/Clip_1.gif?t=1742371748\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Utilizing Critical Effects provides a new strategy for players during combat. And along with Harold\u2019s unique Next Effects and Counter Effects to customize, Reviving An Angel competes with its one-of-a-kind and intriguing combat system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/clip2_optimize.gif?t=1742371748\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Join Harold in exploring the Regalia Continent, where a war with Archangel Lucifer imbued the lands for thousands of years. Collect artifacts, learn powerful skills and craft the best equipment while relishing unforgettable storylines full of twists and turns. All to Revive An Angel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/Clip4.gif?t=1742371748\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Wishlist now here on Steam!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3598060/extras/Clip3_op